<title>USA: CCC seeks corn for Uganda, Mozambique and Angola.</title>
<headline>CCC seeks corn for Uganda, Mozambique and Angola.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp (CCC) of the U.S. Agriculture Department said it seeks to buy 27,170 tonnes of No. 2 yellow corn for donation to Uganda, Mozambique and Angola.</p>
<p>Offers are due at the CCC's Kansas City office by 1400 CST (2000 GMT) on February 5.</p>
<p>The CCC said 10,000 tonnes will be donated to Uganda, 9,260 to Mozambique and 7,910 to Angola.</p>
<p>Shipment of all three amounts was to be March 1-25.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
